Package: oocmp
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: BYTE COMPARATOR
 Instant byte-by-byte file comparison reporting first byte difference and line count.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 detailed octal/decimal difference output, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
